  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Union Support Programme (IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The African Union Support Programme (AUSP IV) has as overall objective to contribute to an integrated, prosperous and peaceful Africa, driven by its own citizens and representing a dynamic force in the international arena and the specific objective of contributing to the transformation of the AUC into an efficient and value addition institution to accelerate the AU institutional reform process, guide the advancement of the 2063 Agenda of the African Union and consolidate the AU-EU partnership.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
